B.M6=s(["Select resistant hybrids","Deep-plow crop residues to accelerate breakdown","Ensure proper field drainage"],t.s)
B.Lr=s(["Liquid copper soaps","Neem oil sprays","Foliar sprays of beneficial microbe mixtures"],t.s)
B.Hf=new A.cx("Gray Leaf Spot","Cercospora zeae-maydis","Gray leaf spot is a persistent fungal disease characterized by rectangular, gray-to-brown spots on corn leaves. It overwinters in crop residues and can cause severe blighting under warm, moist conditions.",B.NY,B.OK,B.M5,B.M6,B.Lr,"Approximately 3 to 4 weeks depending on severity.","Walk fields weekly after silking and check lower leaves for vein-bounded gray rectangular spots.",null)
B.MH=s(["Exserohilum turcicum fungus","Moderate temperatures (18-27\xb0C)","Prolonged moisture (heavy dew or rain)"],t.s)
B.Om=s(["Long, elliptical cigar-shaped grayish-green lesions","Dusty dark spores in centers of spots during humid spells","Premature leaf death"],t.s)
B.Li=s(["Apply strobilurin or triazole fungicides","Rotate with non-grass crops","Plow crop residue down"],t.s)
B.Lb=s(["Choose resistant hybrids","Space plants properly","Destroy infected crop residues"],t.s)
B.LM=s(["Copper hydroxide sprays","Neem oil formulations","Regular compost tea foliar sprays"],t.s)
B.Hb=new A.cx("Northern Leaf Blight","Exserohilum turcicum","Northern leaf blight produces large, cigar-shaped grayish-green lesions on corn leaves. It causes rapid tissue death under moderate, humid conditions and is highly damaging during the grain-fill stage.",B.MH,B.Om,B.Li,B.Lb,B.LM,"Approximately 3 to 5 weeks for foliage protection; existing spots do not heal.","Check lower leaves weekly during warm, moist weather. Catching cigar-shaped lesions early protects the ears.",null)
B.Lp=s(["Balanced nitrogen-phosphorus-potassium fertilizing","Deep watering","Proper soil pH","Adequate sunlight"],t.s)
B.LI=s(["Dark green uniform coloration","Smooth edges","Sturdy upright leaf angle","No powdery rust or leaf lesions"],t.s)
B.LH=s(["Continue standard weeding","Side-dress nitrogen","Monitor water schedules"],t.s)
B.KW=s(["Regular field walks","Crop rotation","Test soil nutrients annually"],t.s)
